败仍需Windows原始进程证据，不能仅凭后端未改认定环境波动。父push38533772616与新push38535387208/PR38535398225以实际终态为准，禁止用另一成功覆盖失败或重跑求绿，暂不新打包。\n\n已验证安装候选38524086177/artifact11875775415仍只归aae，不含f545/51a界面修复。PR4保持草稿、main和其他PR未合并；Windows现有唯一实例不操作、Mac仅后台。原CPU/RSS失败、完整双平台/安装保留/更新备份事件/真实周期、FZ50未许可门禁保持，不签名、发布、stable晋升或关闭。\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:47:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T08:33:16Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fe4fb178d7ea70e376a60321624bd538795e61d7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/4/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/4/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/4/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/statuses/51a35effb3bea7b8f49a73e508e45152881790f7","head":{"label":"gzers:feature/0.1.10-integration-candidate","ref":"feature/0.1.10-integration-candidate","sha":"51a35effb3bea7b8f49a73e508e45152881790f7","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https: